1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,800
The lesson I want

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,000
to pass on:

3
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,520
acceptance.

4
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,200
Everyone is different.

5
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,080
No one is better

6
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,480
than anyone else.

7
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,080
And as long as

8
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,200
you work hard

9
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,480
you can achieve anything

10
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,000
you put your mind to.

11
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,520
It takes a village.

12
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,890
Mine starts at home.

